// Directed testModeLtsm test of UcieDigitalTop, meant to be read in the
// QuestaSim waveform (UcieDigitalTopTestModeLtsmDirected_wave.do) and also
// self-checking.
// GENERATED by gen_block_test_mode_tbs.py from the UcieDigitalTop port list and
// the ltsm instance in UcieDigitalCore; rerun the script if either changes.
//
// Steps (tb_step shows the current one in the waveform):
//   1 NORMAL_INJECT: normal operation, functional reset released, functional
//     LTSM inputs idle. The jtagLtsm_* inputs get start/stable/ready, the
//     whole partner SBINIT message sequence and then all-ones. Every
//     u_core.ltsm port must keep its value, the LTSM stays in RESET and every
//     jtagLtsm_* output stays 0.
//   2 LTSM_TO_MBINIT: reset asserted, testModeLtsm set, reset released. The
//     test plays the partner die on jtagLtsm_sb_rx_* (two clock patterns,
//     OOR success, DONE req, DONE resp) and checks the LTSM walks
//     RESET -> SBINIT -> MBINIT, reading jtagLtsm_state and jtagLtsm_sb_tx_*.
//   3 ALL_ONES: every jtagLtsm_* input (except the clock) held at 1 for 10
//     LTSM clock cycles; every u_core.ltsm input must read all-ones.
//   4 BACK_TO_NORMAL: reset asserted, testModeLtsm cleared, reset released,
//     10 cycles; the LTSM must be in RESET and jtagLtsm_* outputs 0.
// ltsm.cycles_1us has no TDR pin: it comes from the functional cycles_1us pin
// in every step (held at CYCLES_1US).

`timescale 1ns/1ps
`default_nettype none

module UcieDigitalTopTestModeLtsmDirectedSpec_tb;
